    {
      "id": "claim-indus-script-undeciphered",
      "kind": "fact",
      "statement": {
        "zh": "印度河文字因缺乏双语文本等原因，在学界仍无普遍接受的破译——此为研究现况，非「永不可破」断言。",
        "en": "Indus script remains without a generally accepted decipherment (no bilingual texts) — research status, not permanent undecipherability."
      },
