      "kind": "fact",
      "statement": {
        "zh": "摩亨佐-达罗等整合期城市具有发达的井与排水系统；功能标签（大浴场/粮仓）仍属推测。",
        "en": "Integration Era cities such as Mohenjo-daro have elaborate wells and drains; functional labels (Great Bath/granaries) remain speculative."
