    {
      "id": "claim-indus-ghaggar-monsoon-fed",
      "kind": "fact",
      "statement": {
        "zh": "Giosan 等 2012：全新世加加尔–哈克拉为季风补给河流，而非大型冰川补给喜马拉雅河；干旱化与河流景观稳定相关。",
        "en": "Giosan et al. 2012: Holocene Ghaggar-Hakra rivers were monsoon-fed, not a large glacier-fed Himalayan river; aridification linked to fluvial landscape stabilization."
      },
