    {
      "id": "claim-indus-meluhha-contact",
      "kind": "fact",
      "statement": {
        "zh": "楔形文字 Meluhha 地名多数学者与印度河区对应；海湾与两河语境有哈拉帕风格器物——路线级细节须专文。",
        "en": "Cuneiform Meluhha is widely linked to the Indus region; Harappan-style objects appear in Gulf/Mesopotamian contexts — route-level detail needs dedicated entries."
      },
