      "id": "claim-indus-empire-vs-network",
      "kind": "hypothesis",
      "statement": {
        "zh": "整合期政治形态是否最好标为领土「帝国」、城市—区域网络或「国家」仍属开放争议；事实栏只描述城市与标准化证据。",
        "en": "Whether the Integration Era is best labeled territorial “empire,” city–regional network, or “state” remains open; fact columns describe urbanism and standardization only."
